{"4970540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isles of Innsmouth", "steam_appid": 4970540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isles of Innsmouth is a single-player minimalist city-builder inspired by Lovecraftian Horror and cozy New England fishing villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place buildings to grow your settlement and appease the Elder Gods. They reward you with new islands and structures. Discover synergies to improve your score, or just relax and build in creative sandbox mode to enjoy the cozy-horror vibes.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist City-Builder:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex economy or resources to manage, just place buildings from your available cards. Uncover synergies between building types to improve your score. Unlock additional islands and cards to increase the size of your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/5418fad721e6de07cd92a320a9ac38a5.poster.avif?t=1786820838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/5418fad721e6de07cd92a320a9ac38a5.webm?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/5418fad721e6de07cd92a320a9ac38a5.mp4?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Different Structures:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 different structures available to discover. Synergies between buildings increase your score and add visual interest to your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/12edbcf384faec9c32c5fb22461a37e8.poster.avif?t=1786820838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/12edbcf384faec9c32c5fb22461a37e8.webm?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/12edbcf384faec9c32c5fb22461a37e8.mp4?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Islands:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are the same, with unique deck order and island placements each time. Share seeds with your friends to see who can get the best score.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/be13e10bf4523c1fcced4db1e6a755e1.poster.avif?t=1786820838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/be13e10bf4523c1fcced4db1e6a755e1.webm?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/be13e10bf4523c1fcced4db1e6a755e1.mp4?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Sandbox Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t want to keep score? Use creative sandbox mode to relax and build, soaking in the cozy-horror vibes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the camera, lighting, and weather effects to capture the perfect photo of your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/9156fc6117cef9fe19145e244828e08a.poster.avif?t=1786820838\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/9156fc6117cef9fe19145e244828e08a.webm?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4970540/extras/9156fc6117cef9fe19145e244828e08a.mp4?t=1786820838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into a flow state and enjoy an original gloomy ambient soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isles of Innsmouth is a single-player minimalist city-builder inspired by Lovecraftian Horror and cozy New England fishing villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place buildings to grow your settlement and appease the Elder Gods. They reward you with new islands and structures. Discover synergies to improve your score, or just relax and build in creative sandbox mode to enjoy the cozy-horror vibes.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist City-Builder:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex economy or resources to manage, just place buildings from your available cards. Uncover synergies between building types to improve your score. Unlock additional islands and cards to increase the size of your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster